# Local Claude Code config stays out of git — settings, and the repo's own
# context pack, which is regenerated rather than edited. One exception below.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*

# The monō foundry context pack ships. It is a curated read of monō ai's
# published documentation at commit c0e1c095, and it is the derivation source
# for the triage wedge's MCP and skill artifacts. research/source-paths.json
# records the pinned SHA, which is what makes "validated against the documented
# contract at the pinned commit" a checkable claim rather than an assertion.
!.claude/skills/mono-foundry-context/

# ...but not the skill-engine plugin's own machinery. These are generated
# tooling templates, not authored content, and they describe the harness rather
# than the work.
.claude/skills/mono-foundry-context/verify.sh
.claude/skills/mono-foundry-context/evals/
.claude/skills/mono-foundry-context/research/.discover-inventory.json
.claude/skills/mono-foundry-context/research/.research-state.json

# Local-only docs
project-spec.md